{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45299","headline":"赋颜氏古今一事得晋仙传送颜逸 · 皎然","name":"赋颜氏古今一事得晋仙传送颜逸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾看颜氏传，多记晋时仙。\n却忆桐君老，俱还桂父年。\n青春留鬓发，白日向云烟。\n远别賷遗简，囊中有几篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}